  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nNightmare Side originated as a horror radio show from Ardan Radio, running since 1997, and sharing real spooky stories from the citizens of Bandung City, Indonesia. In this game, players will explore the radio office itself, which is famously haunted.<p></p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Don’t Listen to Nightmare Side Alone” Mechanic:</b> This tagline of the show is an actual mechanic in the game. The longer you listen to the show alone, the more danger you face.\n</li><li><b>Meticulously Recreated Real-Life Location:</b> The game takes place in the Ardan Radio office, recreated 1:1 compared to the real location in Bandung, Indonesia, offering an authentic spooky atmosphere.\n</li><li><b>Authentic Indonesian Lore based on Investigation:</b> Encounter authentic Indonesian lore discovered during our investigations and interviews, along with unsettling new discoveries.\n</li><li><b>Original Cast and Radio Show Episodes:</b> The game features Dimasta, the renowned presenter of the Nightmare Side show, and includes some of the actual episode recordings broadcasted in the game.\n</li></ul>\n",
